@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 11: AI Voice/Chatbot Assistant (Proposed)

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Customer
actor Worker
actor "Serviqo Web or Mobile Client" as Client
actor "Conversational AI Assistant" as Assistant
actor "Speech Recognition Service" as SpeechRecognition
actor "Text-to-Speech Service" as TextToSpeech
actor "Serviqo Central Backend" as Backend

rectangle "Serviqo AI Voice/Chatbot Assistant (Not Implemented)" {
  usecase "Ask the assistant for help" as AskAssistant
  usecase "Exchange natural-language\ntext messages" as TextConversation
  usecase "Select English or Urdu" as SelectLanguage
  usecase "Speak a request" as VoiceInput
  usecase "Convert speech to text" as TranscribeSpeech
  usecase "Hear spoken assistant\nresponses" as HearResponse
  usecase "Convert response text\nto speech" as SynthesizeSpeech

  usecase "Find suitable service\ncategories" as FindCategory
  usecase "Describe service\nrequirements" as DescribeRequirements
  usecase "Guide customer through\ncreating a service request" as GuideRequest
  usecase "Guide user through\nplatform navigation and FAQs" as ProvideGuidance
  usecase "Retrieve relevant service\nand job information" as RetrieveInformation

  usecase "Apply authenticated\nrole-based permissions" as ApplyPermissions
  usecase "Request confirmation before\nsubmitting or changing a request" as ConfirmAction
  usecase "Submit or modify a request" as ManageRequest
}

Customer -- AskAssistant
Worker -- AskAssistant
Client -- AskAssistant

AskAssistant ..> TextConversation : <<include>>
AskAssistant ..> SelectLanguage : <<include>>
AskAssistant ..> ProvideGuidance : <<include>>
AskAssistant ..> FindCategory : <<extend>>
AskAssistant ..> DescribeRequirements : <<extend>>
AskAssistant ..> GuideRequest : <<extend>>
AskAssistant ..> RetrieveInformation : <<extend>>

VoiceInput ..> TranscribeSpeech : <<include>>
VoiceInput -- SpeechRecognition
HearResponse ..> SynthesizeSpeech : <<include>>
SynthesizeSpeech -- TextToSpeech
Client -- VoiceInput
Client -- HearResponse

GuideRequest ..> ApplyPermissions : <<include>>
GuideRequest ..> ConfirmAction : <<include>>
ConfirmAction ..> ManageRequest : <<extend>>

RetrieveInformation -- Backend
ManageRequest -- Backend
ApplyPermissions -- Backend

note right of ConfirmAction
The assistant must obtain explicit
user confirmation before submitting
or modifying a service request.
end note

note bottom of ApplyPermissions
Any user-specific information or action
must be authorized by the shared backend
for the authenticated user's role.
end note

note bottom of AskAssistant
This is a proposed web and mobile
assistant. The conversational AI,
English/Urdu handling, speech services,
and assistant-specific APIs are not
currently implemented.
end note

@enduml
